-- The conflict in the class can't be ranked: all three pieces are at 1.
-- It must not take the ranking away from the two failures beside it,
-- which share the code of `half`. `half` fails on trusted evidence, so
-- its code is wrong for sure, and `quarter` may be wrong too or not.
evidence not correct(half(0)) at 1
evidence quarter_uniform at 1
evidence correct(quarter(0)) at 1
evidence not correct(quarter(1)) at 1
